4.4 Approval Workflows
Single Approver:
Request Type: Software Installation (free)
Approval Flow:
  1. Direct Manager → Approve/Reject
  If Approved → Route to Desktop Support
  If Rejected → Close request, notify user
Multi-Level Approval:
Request Type: New Laptop ($2000)
Approval Flow:
  1. Direct Manager → Approve/Reject
  If Approved AND Cost > $1000:
    2. IT Director → Approve/Reject
  If Approved AND Cost > $5000:
    3. CFO → Approve/Reject
  All Approved → Route to Procurement
  Any Rejected → Close request, notify user
Parallel Approval:
Request Type: Database Admin Access
Approval Flow:
  1a. Direct Manager (concurrent)
  1b. Database Team Lead (concurrent)
  1c. Security Team (concurrent)
  All Must Approve → Route to Database Team for provisioning
  Any Rejection → Close request
Conditional Approval:
Request Type: VPN Access
Approval Flow:
  IF User is Employee:
    1. Direct Manager only
  IF User is Contractor:
    1. Hiring Manager
    2. IT Security
    3. Legal (if international contractor)
