* Tags (keywords for search)
* Related Articles (links to similar articles)
* Related Incidents/Problems (links to tickets)
Metadata:
* Author (person who wrote article)
* Owner (person responsible for accuracy)
* Published Date
* Last Updated Date
* Version (track revisions)
