* Expiration Date (when article should be retired)
Publishing Workflow:
* Draft (being written)
* Review (sent for peer/manager review)
* Approved (ready to publish)
* Published (visible to intended audience)
* Retired (no longer accurate, archived)
Audience:
* Internal (IT staff only)
* External (end users can see in self-service portal)
