Usage Metrics:
* View Count
* Helpful Count (thumbs up)
* Not Helpful Count (thumbs down)
* Attached to Incidents (how many times used to resolve)
* Comments/Feedback
7.3 Knowledge-Centered Service (KCS)
Capture:
* Create articles during incident resolution
* Template: Problem + Solution
* Link article to incident for validation
Structure:
* Consistent formatting
* Clear title (includes keywords)
* Step-by-step instructions
* Screenshots or videos
* Prerequisites listed
* Expected outcome stated
Reuse:
* Search knowledge base while working on incident
* Attach article to incident when used
* Track article effectiveness (did it solve the issue?)
Improve:
* Flag article as "needs update" if inaccurate
* Review article feedback (helpful/not helpful votes)
* Update based on new information
* Retire outdated articles
Review Cycle:
Every 90 days:
  - Review articles with low helpful rating (<60%)
  - Review articles with high view count (>100 views)
  - Review articles with no recent usage
  - Update or retire as needed
7.4 Knowledge Base Search
Search Features:
* Full-text search across all articles
